{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "duo_lmars_pistar",
    "description": "Chen (2021) LMARS interface solve, Eq 12 = Eq 20: the full LMARS interface pressure, Pi* = Pi_bar + Pi_vis (Eq 20 = Eq 12). Provided as the sum of its two published parts so both the plain LMARS flux rule and the L97 split rule draw on the SAME averaging and viscous atoms. AXIS- AND DIRECTION-NEUTRAL scalar algebra taking the four reconstructed states at one cell interface -- the EAST value of the left cell (uE, piE, from duo_recon_*) and the WEST value of the right cell (uW, piW) -- so a y-interface reuses it verbatim with the North/South reconstructions bound in. Pi = G h is the pressure forcing (kept distinct from the transported depth h, which is chosen by upwinding). Semi-discrete: the ODE integrator owns dt.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:stencil",
      "family:finite_volume",
      "grid:duo",
      "op:riemann",
      "order:2",
      "scheme:lmars"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Chen, X. (2021). The LMARS based shallow-water dynamical core on generic gnomonic cubed sphere geometry. Journal of Advances in Modeling Earth Systems, 13(1), e2020MS002280. (Section 3.2 Eqs 11-13 LMARS interface solve; Section 3.3 Eqs 20-22 the L97-compatible averaging/viscous split.)",
        "doi": "10.1029/2020MS002280"
      },
      {
        "citation": "Chen, X., Andronova, N., Van Leer, B., Penner, J. E., Boyd, J. P., Jablonowski, C., & Lin, S.-J. (2013). A control-volume model of the compressible Euler equations with a vertical Lagrangian coordinate. Monthly Weather Review, 141(7), 2526-2544. (Origin of the Low Mach number Approximate Riemann Solver.)",
        "doi": "10.1175/MWR-D-12-00129.1"
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    {
      "ref": "./duo_lmars_pibar.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "./duo_lmars_pivis.esm"
    }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "duo_lmars_pistar": {
      "params": [
        "uE",
        "uW",
        "piE",
        "piW"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "duo_lmars_pibar",
            "bindings": {
              "piE": "piE",
              "piW": "piW"
            }
          },
          {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "duo_lmars_pivis",
            "bindings": {
              "uE": "uE",
              "uW": "uW",
              "piE": "piE",
              "piW": "piW"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
